{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"bea5d1a9c6690721391647b2ec3ea4ae711c0cb2337c2dfadd747256a20fc566","ja":"一難去って……","zh":"一难刚过……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"80697bf09a2030c42ca9df23769e3443cfee16689ab39f32b467cbdf13499d0f","ja":"ど、どうしよう……ラーメン屋さんまで\n探しに行った方が良いかしら？","zh":"怎、怎么办才好……是不是去拉面店\n找找看比较好呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9546c5c0bccd973d9c7134302359c95b89c36411b4514cfa34c26704fd268be7","ja":"そ、そうですわね。周りは住宅も多いですし、\n一旦、私服に着替えて……。","zh":"说、说的也是呢。周围民居也很多，\n先换成便服吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"44ed1195685d6abe24b3149c805c37d6ccfac3c7880fc63dbbcc58260e408e26","ja":"あっ、でもでも～。その前に、\nスタジオの裏は探しました？","zh":"啊，不过不过～在那之前，\n录音棚后面找过了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f806c07ad29e5436b45efd4cbced30ef3a808dd5095f24a50ddf8ca4b412b929","ja":"私、これから行くところなんです♪","zh":"我现在正要去呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"14ce0f01cc63f6b2dde34007b0a73780588d960a8985ef0e84b466e23a2c22c4","ja":"裏はまだ見ていませんわね……。\nそれじゃあ、行ってみましょう。","zh":"背面还没看过呢……\n那么，我们去看看吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"74163a1f8b19621601fbb800d387c8eb16aff5ae6dee397dcd6319bf3869344f","ja":"この辺りにいてくれるといいのですけど……。","zh":"要是就在这附近就好了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"233874daff80350da2c100252f73e82070cbcb20d8e8e4987b561ea47fa0a334","ja":"たっかねちゃ～ん、あっそびましょ～！！","zh":"小贵～音，来～玩吧——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"1a40e886937a43f55b5d887a0696fa85bb9c8b8b664ca42460001cce4cab68f7","ja":"ズルズルッ、ズルズルッ……","zh":"哧溜哧溜，哧溜哧溜……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"4a56a944add48e7c13f13b075d18edf1682dcb89721aeccbee29adb12f405472","ja":"あれっ！　この音と匂いって、もしかして……。","zh":"哎呀！这个声音和香味，难道说……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"eb21dfa02cb7581460ce876052cc6832c34839d4c7e1da05aec3e5ab81770df6","ja":"ふう……大変美味でした♪","zh":"呼……真是非常美味♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"3dd3de0d09a2deed3617fad997c0af93c8d58d483d55922378a0a47f1425532c","ja":"貴音ちゃん！　どうしてこんなところで、\nラーメンを食べてるの？","zh":"贵音！你怎么会在这种地方\n吃拉面啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"c5537b847b6b5db8803a8d32d6cbb32640e10b5788993ca1bbe37e80a6be40ec","ja":"出前を頼んだのですが、少々香りが強い\nらーめんでしたので、控え室では避けた方が良いかと。","zh":"虽然叫了外卖，但这碗拉面的味道稍微有点冲，\n在休息室里吃恐怕不太好。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"5c75ca7a60a3c12b86364375d067601eae19c9e27021336362d3f06d98a9ac3b","ja":"ところで、慌てているようですが、\n私にご用でしょうか？","zh":"话说回来，您看起来挺着急的，\n找我有事吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"51b80a2c35649dffc5bee3ddae4f8e3d0d4e9e80185055aea0eba4c791ae99ba","ja":"そうそう！　そろそろ出番だからって、\nあずささんが探してたわよ！","zh":"对对！说是快轮到出场了，\n梓小姐在找你呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"a8db67ac85b875ad9e495440e538278e0a6771cd4575c182cea9269cbeb0d9b1","ja":"なんと……！　つい堪能して、\n時間を忘れてしまっていました。すぐに参ります。","zh":"哎呀……！一时沉浸其中，\n竟忘了时间。我马上就过去。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"759283cfb756b903e7c36d93fb4677d7f83994b98334e399a9d2394a9e443378","ja":"ふぅ、見つかって良かったですわ。ところで、\nどうして麗花はここに来ようとしていましたの？","zh":"呼，能找到真是太好了。话说回来，\n丽花为什么会想要来这里呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"1f9bd316f0bf6a3d7117c4c50c1589ffa93f2e5fb8e4ef5c91248bad144e3c68","ja":"あっ、そうだっ！\nあずささん見なかった？","zh":"啊，对了！\n你看到梓小姐了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"1e9b59239201d33b6bff2543d7ff8e208d592f6a677865778f9f9e3cfc88bcce","ja":"貴音ちゃんの次の出番だから呼んできてって\n言われて、探してたの。","zh":"有人叫我去找贵音，\n因为接下来就轮到她出场了。所以正在找她呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"fe4969cb2f25ef692a14f01168eae11a4cf81ff01ae18a53be858977be63ec5c","ja":"スタジオの外の方に行くのを見たってスタッフさんが\nいたから、ここかなって思ったんだけど……。","zh":"有工作人员说看到朝演播室外面的方向去了，\n所以我还以为是在这里……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"7f170975e9c7ba822b6212328c9faf89bb08f5436c7c71708821c1c417487ae2","ja":"こちらにはいないようですわね。\nあずさも貴音を探していたのですけど……。","zh":"看来不在这里呢。\n梓也在找贵音就是了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1268.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"351911dd428b4976439692560f6e47fdd3952f9fd10364fb3abbfb549b26e7b9","ja":"も、もしかして……あずさの方が、水着の\n衣装のまま外に行ってしまいましたの！？","zh":"难、难道说……梓小姐她，\n穿着泳装外出了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
